{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261101/photo/bkn-20261101112319149-1101_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261101114456\"/><p>事主被送往東區醫院救治。(張開裕攝)</p><p>石澳有人遇溺。今日(11月1日)早上10時43分，一名年約60歲男子在石澳泳灘游泳期間懷疑遇溺，在場人士發現合力將事主救回岸上並進行急救。救護車接報到場將昏迷事主送往東區醫院搶救，人員正了解男子遇溺原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:27.466903+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T03:23:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:32.293914+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:32.293914+00:00","content_hash":"ba8d2b1644040a86ed8717962650dca1f33866a94d46fa4f10cf9e871eda96bd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}